@startuml
class MyTriangle{
    - v1:MyPoint
    - v2:MyPoint
    - v3:MyPoint
    + MyTriangle(x1:int,y1:int,x2:int,y2:int,x3:int,y3:int)
    + MyTriangle(v1:MyPoint,v2:MyPoint,v3:MyPoint)
    + toString():String
    + getPerimeter():double
    + getType():String
}
class MyPoint{
    - x:int
    - y:int
}

note left of MyTriangle::toString
    MyTriangle[v1=(x1,y1),v2=(x2,y2),v3=(x3,y3)]
end note

note left of MyTriangle::getPerimeter
    Use MyPoint's distance() to compute
    the length of the edges
end note

note bottom of MyTriangle
    Equilateral or Isosceles or Scalene
end note
MyTriangle o-right- MyPoint

@enduml